Title: Future Implications

As we move forward, the implications of this uncertainty are profound. Future regulatory frameworks will likely expand to include stricter limits on radio frequency exposure, particularly in densely populated urban centers. Until then, the focus remains on sustainable infrastructure and preventing the spread of misinformation.

